  "id": "riverside",
  "city": "bangkok",
  "name": {
    "en": "Riverside"
  },
  "tagline": {
    "en": "The Chao Phraya, old piers, the big hotels. Slow mornings, boat rides."
  },
  "about": {
    "en": "The Chao Phraya runs along the west edge of the centre, and the riverside strip from Saphan Taksin (BTS S6) up to the old customs house is where the grand hotels stand. Charoen Krung Road behind them is the city's oldest paved street, now full of galleries and cafes; Bang Rak is the market quarter around Si Phraya; across the river, Khlong San has ICONSIAM and the free shuttle boats. Slow mornings, boat rides, and sunset from the water."
  },
